# CronoMapa RD — 100% Free & Open-Source Stack
# No private API keys or credit-card services are required.
# Map Engine: Leaflet.js + React-Leaflet
# Base Tiles: OpenStreetMap, OpenTopoMap, CartoDB Dark Matter, Esri World Imagery
# Geocoding: Nominatim (OpenStreetMap) bounded to Dominican Republic (countrycodes=do)
# Historical Data: Local Static GeoJSON/JSON + Spanish Wikipedia REST API v1 + Wikimedia Commons